{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a single-modality RNA-only model using PCA encoding, achieving validation accuracy of 0.4849 and F1 of 0.4639, lower than the multimodal baseline (0.5266 accuracy, 0.5104 F1). This suggests multimodal approaches may provide performance benefits, but the relative effectiveness of this single-modality configuration compared to other single-modality alternatives remains uncertain."
}

